      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the ask times out (5 s by default) the device now ends up with no mount point at all, while the session stays up so NetconfDevice never reconnects. Before, the mount existed and worked once the actor caught up. Could we either retry the ask or at least mark the device as failed via datastoreAdapter.setDeviceAsFailed() here, so the operator sees it?",
